  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "Once per encounter, as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">Reaction</a>, you can make a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Persuasion\" title=\"Persuasion\">Persuasion</a> check to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Intimidate\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Intimidate\">Intimidate</a> one creature that is making a melee or ranged attack against you, and is within your line of sight. If you succeed, you impose a -5 penalty to that attack roll. If the target is a higher level than you, it gains a +5 bonus to its <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Will_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Will Defense\">Will Defense</a> against the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Intimidate\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Intimidate\">Intimidate</a> check.<br><br>This is a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Mind-Affecting\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mind-Affecting\">Mind-Affecting</a> effect.",
